Undeclared commodities are reported in price directives and every posting annotation.

========== API ==========

accounts()

========== FILE ==========

account Assets:Fund
account Equity:Opening
P 2024-01-01 FUND 10 SEK
2024-01-02 Trade
  Assets:Fund  1 FUND {10 LOT} @ 11 PRICE = 1 ASSERTION
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:Fund",
    "comment": null,
    "used": true,
    "transactionCount": 1
  },
  {
    "account": "Equity:Opening",
    "comment": null,
    "used": true,
    "transactionCount": 1
  }
]

